@startuml Inbound History

title 取得入庫歷程（總管理者：全部倉庫可篩選 AdminOnly；倉庫管理者＋一般員工：限自己倉庫 WarehouseStaffOnly）——共用同一個 Query/Handler/Reader

actor "總管理者" as Admin
actor "倉庫管理者 / 一般員工" as Staff

box "Ordering.Api" #LightBlue
    participant "ListInboundHistoryEndpoint" as AdminEndpoint
    participant "ListWarehouseInboundHistoryEndpoint" as StaffEndpoint
    participant "ICurrentUser" as CurrentUser
end box

box "Ordering.Application" #LightYellow
    participant "ISender" as Sender
    participant "ListInboundHistoryQueryHandler" as Handler
end box

box "Ordering.Infrastructure" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "IInboundOrderReader" as Reader
end box

database "ordering_db" as DB

== 總管理者：GET /api/v1/inbound/history?warehouseId=&productNo=&...&page=&size= ==
Admin -> AdminEndpoint : （warehouseId 可為 null，代表查全部倉庫）
AdminEndpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(ListInboundHistoryQuery(warehouseId, ...))

== 倉庫管理者／一般員工：GET /api/v1/inbound/history/warehouse?... ==
Staff -> StaffEndpoint : （不接受 warehouseId 參數）
StaffEndpoint -> CurrentUser : WarehouseId
StaffEndpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(ListInboundHistoryQuery(currentUser.WarehouseId, ...))

Sender -> Handler : HandleAsync(query, ct)
Handler -> Reader : ListHistoryAsync(warehouseId, productNo, productName,\nrequestedBy, confirmedBy, status, requestedFrom, requestedTo, page, size, ct)

Reader -> DB : select 攤開後的每一筆商品品項\n（一張入庫單、多個商品各自一列，共用同一個 order_no）\nfrom inbound_order_items join inbound_orders join products\nwhere status in ('Confirmed','Rejected')  -- 只顯示已處理的\n  and (@WarehouseId is null or warehouse_id = @WarehouseId)\n  and （其餘篩選條件皆為 optional）
DB --> Reader : 分頁後的 rows，count(*) over() 給總筆數

Reader -> DB : 另外用同一組 where 條件（不分頁）\nselect sum(quantity), sum(unit_price * quantity)
DB --> Reader : TotalQuantity, TotalAmount\n（畫面最下方顯示，不受分頁影響）

Reader --> Handler : InboundHistoryResultDto {\n  Page: PagedResult<InboundHistoryLineDto>,\n  TotalQuantity, TotalAmount\n}
Handler --> Sender : Result.Success
Sender --> Admin : 200 OK
Sender --> Staff : 200 OK

note over Reader, DB
  這是目前對「庫存系統需求 v2.2」第7章
  還原最精確的一支 —— 攤開列表 + 分頁不影響
  的加總，兩者都照文件字面描述實作。
end note

@enduml
